title: Long Reads on AI/ML Engineering
ogtitle: Long Reads on AI/ML Engineering
desc: Six deep technical articles — transformer internals, inference economics, fine-tuning decisions, evaluation engineering, vector search internals, and agent architectures.
og: og-articles.png
